        "original_id": "c03b162d-5bf0-5bb9-9556-0fa5e38ce929",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Boy Hits Car, The Invisible\n- Products: All That Led Us Here, The Invisible\n- Events: album releases, European tour, Mercury Prize nominations\n\nFacts:\n- The Invisible released their self-titled debut album The Invisible on 9 March 2009.\n- The Invisible's debut album The Invisible was nominated for the Mercury Prize and was selected as iTunes critics' choice for album of the year.\n- Boy Hits Car released their fifth studio album All That Led Us Here in May 2014.\n- Boy Hits Car followed the release of All That Led Us Here with a European tour.",
